+[Subjective Immediacy](C01-Subject-Defined-Indefinability.md) is the knower, pramātṛ; Objective Internality is the means, pramāṇa; World is the known, prameya; **Life / Mind is their whole**. Mind in the strong idealist sense is Life, and psychic facticity belongs to its reality. Calling the mediating mind-world an objective internality does not rename that whole as an inventory of objects. [A26](../arguments/A26-Objective-Internality-Mind-as-Worldhood.md) develops this constitutive field and its genealogy; [A/C](../conjugate/AC.md) holds its ethical and primitive relation.
